Coin Dojo — ES-DE theme: licensing
========================================

This theme is part of the Coin Dojo project and follows the same
split licensing as the repository root. See the repo root LICENSE, LICENSE-art
and NOTICE for the authoritative, full texts.

  CODE (the theme markup: capabilities.xml, theme.xml, colors.xml, the
  aspect-ratio-*.xml layout files) ....................... MIT
      -> repo root LICENSE

  ORIGINAL ART (everything under _inc/art/: background.svg, background-16-9.svg,
  deck.png, panel*.png, scrim*.png, backdrops/default.png (generated by
  skills/badges/gen_*.py), dot.svg, rating-filled.svg, rating-empty.svg,
  logo-wordmark.png) ...................................... CC BY-SA 4.0
      -> repo root LICENSE-art
      Suggested attribution:
      "Coin Dojo theme art, CC BY-SA 4.0,
       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"

  BUNDLED FONTS (_inc/fonts/*.ttf) ...................... SIL Open Font License 1.1
      Each face keeps its own license; see the OFL-*.txt files shipped
      alongside the fonts in _inc/fonts/.
        - Archivo Black      (Omnibus-Type)
        - Rajdhani           (Indian Type Foundry)
        - Press Start 2P     (CodeMan38)

SHIPS NO COPYRIGHTED GAME ARTWORK
---------------------------------
This theme reproduces no third-party copyrighted artwork, character art,
logos, marquees or box art. All art here is original work in a comparable
style. Per-game media is supplied at runtime by the user's own scraped
library and is never distributed with this theme.

Game titles, company names and related marks are trademarks and/or copyrights
of their owners. This theme is unofficial, unaffiliated and not endorsed by
any game publisher.
